The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Werewolf''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|5.00%|1|20|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Spooky|Spooky Sea Creatures]] pool with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked.

