== Behavior ==
'''Werewolves''' will run towards the player and attack them, dealing {{Stat|dmg|250}}. The '''Werewolf's''' {{Stat|damage}} increases by {{Red|20%}} for each second it is alive, capping at {{Red|300%}}; thus, it's advisable to swiftly kill the mob.

